        "note": "Crevels has listed the Pano-Takanan Katukina together with varieties of the Harámbut-Katukinan Katukina, so that it is not possible to interpret her speaker figures accuratedly. She gives:\r\nKatukina-Kanamari (Katukina [Tüküná, Pi:Dyapa], Kanamarí [Tüküna Kanamarí, Canamari], Tsohom-Dyapa [Tsunhum-Djapá, Tyonhwak Dyapa], Katukina do Acre, Katukina Pano) with 2239 speakers and 2239 ethnic population (data form 2008). [Date Of Info: 2009]"
